+    <h1>The Ideal 10-Day Morocco Itinerary, and How to Stretch It to Two Weeks</h1>
+    <p>A day-by-day private route through Chefchaouen, Fes, the Sahara and Marrakech, plus the best ways to extend it to 12 or 14 days.</p>
