+          <p>Both can work well. Booking directly with a reputable local Moroccan company usually means more flexibility, direct contact with the people running your trip and better value, because there's no middle layer. International operators offer familiar brands and home-country consumer protections, but many subcontract the actual tour to a local company.</p>
