+          <p>Ask for the company's official registration details (every legally registered Moroccan business has an ICE number), check for a physical address and a working phone line, and read recent, detailed reviews on independent platforms such as TripAdvisor and Google. Pay by card or a traceable method rather than cash transfers to individuals.</p>
